        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A form of Ehlers-Danlos syndrome (EDS) characterized by congenital bilateral hip dislocation severe generalized joint hypermobility with recurrent joint dislocations and subluxations hyperextensible and/or fragile skin."
        },
